WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.650
A crane swings over a scrapyard.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:06.970
There's no hook and no claw,
just a heavy metal disc.

3
00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:11.110
It touches an old car, and
the car lifts off the ground.

4
00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:14.510
Then, right over the
pile, the car drops.

5
00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:17.110
How can the disc let go on command?

6
00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:20.630
In this mission, you'll explore
pushes and pulls that act

7
00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:23.430
without touching: static charge,

8
00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:26.210
magnetic poles and magnetic fields.

9
00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:28.190
You'll see why a compass needle turns,

10
00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:31.810
and what a current in
a coil of wire can do.

11
00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:35.810
Your mission: explain how a
scrapyard crane drops a car on

12
00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:36.900
command.
